{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/matrices-determinants/matrices/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/matrices-determinants/matrices.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Matrices | Mathematics","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-3xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/matrices-determinants/\" class=\"text-blue-600\">← Back to Matrices &amp; Determinants</a></nav>\n    <article class=\"content-card rounded-lg p-6\">\n      <h1 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-2\">Matrices</h1>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Matrix notation, addition, scalar multiplication, matrix multiplication (conformability) and the identity matrix.</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Worked example</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-gray-700\">Add: [[1,2],[3,4]] + [[0,1],[1,0]] = [[1,3],[4,4]].</p>\n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Practice</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-gray-700\">\n        <li>Compute product: [[1,0],[0,1]] × [[2,3],[4,5]].</li>\n        <li>Find scalar multiple: 3 × [[1,2],[3,4]].</li>\n      </ol>\n\n      <h3 class=\"mt-3 font-semibold\">Brief solutions</h3>\n      <ol class=\"list-decimal list-inside text-gray-700\">\n        <li>Product = [[2,3],[4,5]] (identity property).</li>\n        <li>[[3,6],[9,12]].\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-cyan-50 to-sky-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.content-card{-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.95);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}